WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.890 --> 00:00:04.560
- Let's wrap things up,
everybody with one last super

00:00:04.560 --> 00:00:06.930
cute feel good story trending on social.

00:00:06.930 --> 00:00:08.130
This is What I'm Liking.

00:00:10.950 --> 00:00:12.630
When my kids were toddlers,

00:00:12.630 --> 00:00:14.520
I loved watching them discover new things.

00:00:14.520 --> 00:00:17.100
I still do and that's
why I can relate to a set

00:00:17.100 --> 00:00:18.840
of Dallas parents who
have become obsessed,

00:00:18.840 --> 00:00:21.990
with how much their
little girl loves stopping

00:00:21.990 --> 00:00:24.060
and smelling the candles.

00:00:24.060 --> 00:00:25.290
Just look.

00:00:25.290 --> 00:00:26.550
- [Brie] Are you ready
to smell some candles?

00:00:26.550 --> 00:00:27.383
- Yes.

00:00:27.383 --> 00:00:28.216
- [Brie] Okay.

00:00:30.067 --> 00:00:31.234
- [King] Okay.

00:00:32.790 --> 00:00:34.648
- [Brie] You don't like that one?

00:00:34.648 --> 00:00:35.481
- No.

00:00:41.741 --> 00:00:42.574
- Yes.

00:00:42.574 --> 00:00:43.620
- [Brie] You like that one?

00:00:50.166 --> 00:00:51.590
- Yes.

00:00:51.590 --> 00:00:53.629
- That's hysterical.

00:00:53.629 --> 00:00:54.810
That's two year old Sunday,

00:00:54.810 --> 00:00:56.310
and we have her on the line now,

00:00:56.310 --> 00:00:58.260
along with her parents, Brie and King.

00:00:58.260 --> 00:01:00.600
They watch on NBC 5 Dallas Fort Worth.

00:01:00.600 --> 00:01:01.550
Great to see y'all.

00:01:04.129 --> 00:01:04.962
- Can you say hi?

00:01:04.962 --> 00:01:06.045
- Oh my Gosh.

00:01:06.960 --> 00:01:10.230
How she like is just appalled
by some of those candles.

00:01:10.230 --> 00:01:12.450
Like, "how dare you put that in my face."

00:01:12.450 --> 00:01:14.610
Brie, how did you figure out Sunday's

00:01:14.610 --> 00:01:17.130
strong sensibilities on candles?

00:01:17.130 --> 00:01:20.220
- Well, we like to think
it was because of us,

00:01:20.220 --> 00:01:22.500
but once Sunday was born,

00:01:22.500 --> 00:01:24.030
King and I really wanted to make sure that

00:01:24.030 --> 00:01:27.180
we kept our regular date and
something that we've been

00:01:27.180 --> 00:01:31.020
doing for years is going to
our favorite candle shop.

00:01:31.020 --> 00:01:33.060
So when Sunday was around one,

00:01:33.060 --> 00:01:34.410
we started bringing her along,

00:01:34.410 --> 00:01:36.870
and she asked to smell the candles too.

00:01:36.870 --> 00:01:39.420
And then it wasn't long
after that she realized

00:01:39.420 --> 00:01:42.960
that she actually had
preferences for candles.

00:01:42.960 --> 00:01:44.280
And she's very consistent.

00:01:44.280 --> 00:01:46.501
She really likes warm smells,

00:01:46.501 --> 00:01:48.870
spicy smells, like vanilla and cinnamon.

00:01:48.870 --> 00:01:50.880
And she does not like clean smells,

00:01:50.880 --> 00:01:52.920
overly floral smells or fruity smells.

00:01:52.920 --> 00:01:55.110
She'll always say no to those.

00:01:55.110 --> 00:01:55.943
- It's true.

00:01:55.943 --> 00:01:59.010
It's crazy that the world
needed a candle sniffing baby.

00:01:59.010 --> 00:02:01.800
So you're welcome to everyone out there.

00:02:01.800 --> 00:02:04.320
- Oh my God, King, you win.

00:02:04.320 --> 00:02:05.340
That was amazing.

00:02:05.340 --> 00:02:07.500
Well, millions of people
have watched Sunday

00:02:07.500 --> 00:02:08.730
smell the candles online,

00:02:08.730 --> 00:02:11.400
and now she's going to have
her own candles, right?

00:02:11.400 --> 00:02:12.233
- [Brie] Yep.

00:02:12.233 --> 00:02:13.066
- Yeah, she is. It's crazy.

00:02:13.066 --> 00:02:15.544
We partnered with that
candle shop, Jackson Vaughn.

00:02:15.544 --> 00:02:17.130
- I think Justin, you have some, right?

00:02:17.130 --> 00:02:19.803
- [King] And they are putting
together Sunday's Best Bundle.

00:02:19.803 --> 00:02:22.260
It's the candle number
one and number nine,

00:02:22.260 --> 00:02:23.430
and they are phenomenal.

00:02:23.430 --> 00:02:24.469
- [Kelly] Oh my gosh.

00:02:24.469 --> 00:02:26.670
- The number one has notes of eggplant,

00:02:26.670 --> 00:02:30.270
of some Cyprus or some basil.

00:02:30.270 --> 00:02:35.270
The other one has some Moroccan Neroli,

00:02:35.730 --> 00:02:37.200
and some Cyprus as well.

00:02:37.200 --> 00:02:38.370
And they smell delicious.

00:02:38.370 --> 00:02:40.080
So I hope that you enjoy them.

00:02:40.080 --> 00:02:41.190
- I love both.

00:02:41.190 --> 00:02:42.023
Thank you.

00:02:42.023 --> 00:02:44.070
Number nine might be my favorite.

00:02:44.070 --> 00:02:45.331
It's like a little sweeter.

00:02:45.331 --> 00:02:46.420
- Yeah, I think so too.

00:02:46.420 --> 00:02:47.720
So does Sunday. You agree?

00:02:50.190 --> 00:02:52.860
- Thank you so much,
Sunday and Brie and King.

00:02:52.860 --> 00:02:55.050
I'm liking y'alls posts right now.

00:02:55.050 --> 00:02:56.580
And that's not all.

00:02:56.580 --> 00:02:58.688
Our season long partner,
Pilot pen makers of G2,

00:02:58.688 --> 00:03:00.750
the go-to pen of the Kelly Clarkson Show,

00:03:00.750 --> 00:03:02.610
want to honor truly unstoppable people

00:03:02.610 --> 00:03:04.560
like y'all, just making
really cool stuff like this.

00:03:04.560 --> 00:03:05.790
So they're gonna be writing you a check,

00:03:05.790 --> 00:03:07.848
for a thousand dollars.

00:03:07.848 --> 00:03:08.866
- Oh my God.

00:03:08.866 --> 00:03:10.107
- Thank you so much.

00:03:10.107 --> 00:03:11.010
- It smells so good.

00:03:11.010 --> 00:03:13.020
Oh my God, absolutely.

00:03:13.020 --> 00:03:13.890
Well, thank you guys,

00:03:13.890 --> 00:03:15.420
and thank you to all our guests this hour.

00:03:15.420 --> 00:03:18.810
Anthony Anderson, Eliza
Schlesinger, Chef Noah Gluten,

00:03:18.810 --> 00:03:20.490
Bobby Johnson and Sam James.

00:03:20.490 --> 00:03:21.773
Y'all have a great day and if it's not,

00:03:21.773 --> 00:03:22.863
try and change it.

